"The BAFTA Breakthrough US program is an investment in the extraordinary voices shaping what comes next in film, television and games,&#8221; said Courtney LaBarge Bell, executive director of BAFTA North America . &#8220;This year's cohort reflects the imagination, ambition and distinct perspectives that continue to push our industries forward. At a time when emerging creatives face increasing challenges in finding opportunity, mentorship and a path forward, BAFTA is proud to create a space where talent can be recognized, supported and connected to a broader creative community."

